cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, dataset documentation, or FD-Net V2 in your research, please cite this software and the associated research paper when available."

title: "Fabric Defect Diagnosis Using Deep Learning with a Scratch-Trained Lightweight FD-Net V2"

type: software

